spice
* SPICE Netlist
VDD VDD 0 DC <value>
Vin Vin 0 DC <value>
Vb Vb 0 DC <value>
M1 Vout Vin VDD VDD <NMOS_MODEL>
Rs Vout Vout_mid <value>
? Missing component
* The <value> and <NMOS_MODEL> need to be specified as per design specifics
* The net Vout_mid is introduced to connect Rs and M2 appropriately
